{"id":"W771e82ff5080860f4bdb1ff2","zh":"“对号入座”法则","en":"","name":"“对号入座”法则","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W771e82ff5080860f4bdb1ff2","text":"“对号入座”法则","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S6e809763ce22ab1867eb","source_id":"P140","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"视列车、轨道和基础结构为整体系统,以车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论为方法核心,以弹性总势能不变值原理及形成矩阵的“对号入座”法则为建模思路,将三大子系统耦合为动力学统一矩阵方程,建立铁路列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用统一分析模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P140","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S78127fe7a30e4b7a3023","source_id":"P140","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文以车辆−轨道耦合动力学为方法导引 [1],将列车、轨道和基础结构作为动力学统一系统;另外,基于复杂系统宜用能量原理的基本思路,引入弹性总势能不变值原理及形成矩阵的“对号入座”法则 [2],建立了铁路列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用统一分析模型(见图1),现就主要内容加以叙述,并阐明其主要建模过程及基本原理。","citations":[{"source_id":"P140","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P140":{"id":"P140","title":"铁路列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part I:动力学模型构造与求解","authors":"徐磊","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220719","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-model-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-i-the-dynamics"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"将变分表达式中的系数按对应自由度组装到矩阵中。","language":"zh","source_id":"P140","paper_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-model-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-i-the-dynamics","title":"铁路列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part I：动力学模型构造与求解","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"We96d7ba6f16a66b6ba369186","name":"Set-in-right-position rule","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"We96d7ba6f16a66b6ba369186","name":"Set-in-right-position rule","language":"en","kind"